{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49110","headline":"浪淘沙 二 · 後主煜","name":"浪淘沙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往事只堪哀，对景难排。\n秋风庭院藓侵阶，一桁珠帘闲不卷，终日谁来。\n金劒已沈埋，壮气蒿莱。\n晚凉天净月华开，想得玉楼瑶殿影，空照秦淮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}